  "ingredients": [
    "2 (8 ounce) cans refrigerated crescent roll dough",
    "2 (8 ounce) packages cream cheese, softened",
    "1.25 cups white sugar, divided",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "0.5 cup margarine, melted",
    "1 teaspoon ground cinnamon"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zMgN0Rsetxjm55MtUX2eWQ7Xrb4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25832-cream-cheese-squares-ddmfs-Step1-1908-f6c34596e5d84ef3bb92ca0b22ae2548.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25832/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease a 9x13-inch baking pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Unroll one can of crescent rolls and press dough into the bottom of the prepared pan. Set second can aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Z_VPp6cDSWBcbKuHDaXhPhxTniI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25832-cream-cheese-squares-ddmfs-Step2-1909-a08bc21fc676415c8516445dfdb088c0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25832/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir cream cheese, 1 cup sugar, and vanilla together in a medium bowl until smooth and creamy. Spread over crescent dough layer.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-LI-DvNyXpP3YdUk59LSOh9V5v4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25832-cream-cheese-squares-ddmfs-Step4-1914-19b1ac662c284d8f8b345130051a6985.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25832/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Unroll second can of crescent rolls and lay dough on top of cream cheese mixture; do not press down. Pour melted butter all over the top of the dough.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/sTXQbAWMiQq-p_VDCOCAjjLkVmc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25832-cream-cheese-squares-ddmfs-Step6-1918-70c3dba5543a42cf888ddbf61201f8bc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25832/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine remaining 1/4 cup sugar and cinnamon in a small bowl; sprinkle evenly on top.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/a0HOkGk_OMq0ss9mb2Fa1wMLnyo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25832-cream-cheese-squares-ddmfs-Step7B-1920-03975f77b8cc4f4ba495131fb6b0776d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25832/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until top is crisp and golden, 25 to 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/U1Mcye8e-VIGuv_LnBpI1F-7UZ4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25832-cream-cheese-squares-ddmfs-Step8-1922-d607f211ffbe4c09bcd043dcc2757a7e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25832/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once cool, cut into 24 squares. Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7YWa24dNNK6ghVYRCf6ZDfV-GQ0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25832-cream-cheese-squares-ddmfs-3X4-1953-33c272fcc43d45429ae715e14858a2b2.jpg"
